# SurfaceView that is on screen (consumer usage 0x900). Configured on Media3's placeholder
# surface (a SurfaceTexture, usage 0x100) they pick the working DIP mode and keep it after
# setOutputSurface. So: configure every video decoder on the placeholder, then move it to
# the real surface right before the first frame is rendered.

